<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Your account has been deleted</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin:0;padding:24px;background:#f5f6f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2933;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:32px;">
          <p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;">{{brand.name}}</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">{{#if customer.firstName}}Hello {{customer.firstName}},{{else}}Hello,{{/if}}</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Your {{brand.name}} account was deleted on {{deletion.requestedAt}} (UTC), as you asked. You can no longer sign in to it, and the personal data of the account is erased by {{deletion.erasureDueBy}} (UTC) at the latest.</p>
          {{#if deletion.bookingsKept}}
          <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">The records of your bookings are kept for as long as airline settlement, tax and accounting rules require, then deleted.</p>
          {{/if}}
          <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">You can create a new account with this e-mail address at any time.</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">If you did not ask for this, tell {{brand.name}} at once{{#if brand.supportEmail}} at <a href="mailto:{{brand.supportEmail}}">{{brand.supportEmail}}</a>{{/if}}{{#if brand.supportPhone}}{{#if brand.supportEmail}} or{{/if}} on {{brand.supportPhone}}{{/if}}.</p>
          <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;"><a href="{{brand.storefrontUrl}}">{{brand.name}}</a></p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
